      "note": "The entire IMS signaling plane failed due to a fault on the Cx interface. Both I-CSCF and S-CSCF reported 100% timeouts when querying the HSS, leading to a complete halt of registrations and call setups."
    },
    "core": {
      "rating": "green",
      "evidence": [],
